From b6cc4bc43f6ad9bbbd24aeb8f6ba7dddda2cce20 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sami Slimani <slimsamister@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:06:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] port: drop the DFlash2 context skip and the prefill step
 grid

Both need core changes upstream does not have: the skip needs
IDraftBackend::TargetContextWindow/SkipTargetContext, the verifier's
keep_context_from and TextModelRunner::SetDraftContextHorizon; the grid needs
TextRunnerDescriptor::prefill_step_tokens. The skip was left out on purpose
(small gain on Gufo main); without the grid field, checkpoints fall back to
Gufo's fixed 2,048-token grid. QwenDFlashGpuExecutor::SkipTargetContextTo stays
for a later return.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 q35/model/hip/dflash.hpp         |  5 ----
 q35/model/hip/dflash/backend.cpp | 27 ----------------------
 q35/model/runner.cpp             | 39 +++++---------------------------
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 65 deletions(-)

